  "fullDescription": "Create, customize, and save time with this massive All-in-One Life & Wellness Planner template built in Canva.\n\nEasily customize colors, fonts, logos, icons, layouts, and branding to make it completely your own—perfect for printable planners, binder systems, client projects, and creative businesses.\n\nThis professionally designed planner includes 104 carefully crafted pages covering productivity, planning, finance, health, fitness, self-care, home management, and so much more.\n\nFully editable and easy to update for 2028, 2029, 2030 & beyond, this timeless planner system can be reused again and again to create premium printables for years to come.\n\nINCLUDES 104 PROFESSIONALLY DESIGNED PAGES\n1. Yearly Planning & Goal Setting\n\n✔ 2027 Calendar\n✔ Yearly Goals\n✔ Important Dates\n✔ Vision & Planning Pages\n\n2. Daily, Weekly & Monthly Planning\n\n✔ Daily Planners\n✔ Weekly Planners\n✔ Monthly Planners\n✔ Notes & Planning Pages\n\n3. Productivity & Organization\n\n✔ Brain Dump\n✔ To-Do Lists\n✔ Habit Trackers\n✔ Routine Builders\n✔ Focus & Task Management\n\n4. Finance & Budgeting\n\n✔ Family Budget\n✔ Debt Snowball\n✔ Savings Trackers\n✔ Income & Expense Logs\n✔ Subscription Trackers\n\n5. Health & Medical\n\n✔ Medical Quick View\n✔ Medication Trackers\n✔ Symptom Logs\n✔ Sleep Trackers\n✔ Doctor Visit Logs\n\n6. Fitness & Nutrition\n\n✔ Weekly Meal Planners\n✔ Grocery Lists\n✔ Workout Plans\n✔ Weight Trackers\n✔ Nutrition Logs\n\n7. Self-Care & Personal Growth\n\n✔ 30-Day Self-Care Challenge\n✔ Gratitude Journal\n✔ Anxiety Trackers\n✔ Positive Mindset Pages\n✔ Reflection Journals\n\n8. Home & Lifestyle\n\n✔ Chore Charts\n✔ Password Trackers\n✔ Contact Lists\n✔ Pet Trackers\n✔ Household Organization\n\nFEATURES\n\n✔ Fully Editable in Canva\n✔ 1 High-Resolution PDF File (104 Pages) Ready to Print\n✔ BONUS: 104 Individual High-Resolution JPG Pages\n✔ Standard 8.5 x 11 in (Letter Size)\n✔ Clean Margins for Hole Punching & Binding\n✔ Minimal Visual Clutter for Maximum Focus\n✔ Calming Pastel Aesthetic Design\n✔ Easily resize for multiple print formats using Canva Pro\n\n★ HOW TO USE ★\n\n✔ Download your files after purchase\n✔ Open the included PDF and click the template link\n✔ Customize colors, fonts, icons, pages, and branding inside Canva\n✔ Duplicate pages to create unlimited planner variations\n✔ Print at home, with an online printing service, or at your local print shop\n✔ Reuse your template again and again for future planner projects\n\nThis is a digital product for printing.\nNo physical item will be shipped.\n\nStart creating your own premium planner today.",
